{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'cat lib/main.dart && cat pubspec.yaml && cat README.md && ls -la'","aggregated_output":"import 'package:flutter/material.dart';\nimport 'package:posthog_flutter/posthog_flutter.dart';\n\nimport 'analytics.dart';\nimport 'screens/offer_screen.dart';\nimport 'screens/registration_screen.dart';\n\nFuture<void> main() async {\n  WidgetsFlutterBinding.ensureInitialized();\n  await Analytics.init();\n  runApp(const KreditoApp());\n}\n\nclass KreditoApp extends StatelessWidget {\n  const KreditoApp({super.key});\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return PostHogWidget(\n      child: MaterialApp(\n        title: 'Kredito',\n        theme: ThemeData(colorSchemeSeed: Colors.green, useMaterial3: true),\n        navigatorObservers: [PosthogObserver()],\n        routes: {\n          '/': (_) => const RegistrationScreen(),\n          '/offers': (_) => const OfferScreen(),\n        },\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\nname: kredito\ndescription: Consumer loan registration and offers.\npublish_to: \"none\"\nversion: 1.3.0+27\n\nenvironment:\n  sdk: ^3.5.0\n\ndependencies:\n  flutter:\n    sdk: flutter\n  posthog_flutter: ^5.36.0\n\ndev_dependencies:\n  flutter_test:\n    sdk: flutter\n  flutter_lints: ^5.0.0\n\nflutter:\n  uses-material-design: true\n# kredito\n\nFlutter app (iOS + Android) for a consumer loan broker. The user registers\nwith an email and a phone number, picks the amount they want to borrow, accepts\nthe terms and gets a list of offers from partner banks. Two screens so far:\n`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart` and `lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`.\n\nAnalytics is PostHog (`posthog_flutter`), set up in `lib/analytics.dart` and\n`lib/main.dart`; screen views come from `PosthogObserver`. We are on the\nPostHog free tier. Product events are defined in `docs/EVENTS.md`; the\nscreens do not send any of them yet. Send events through `Analytics.capture`\nso the key and host stay in one place.\ntotal 24\ndrwx------    8 valentinakoniukhova  wheel    256 Oct 27 15:26 .\ndrwxrwxrwt  391 root                 wheel  12512 Oct 27 15:26 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x   12 valentinakoniukhova  wheel    384 Oct 27 15:26 .git\n-rw-r--r--    1 valentinakoniukhova  wheel    656 Oct 27 15:26 README.md\n-rw-r--r--    1 valentinakoniukhova  wheel     44 Oct 27 15:26 analysis_options.yaml\ndrwxr-xr-x    3 valentinakoniukhova  wheel     96 Oct 27 15:26 docs\ndrwxr-xr-x    5 valentinakoniukhova  wheel    160 Oct 27 15:26 lib\n-rw-r--r--    1 valentinakoniukhova  wheel    316 Oct 27 15:26 pubspec.yaml\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
